Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:04.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不久前才經歷過大戰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:07.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭結束時亦曾誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:10.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不會重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:13.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底為何會這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:21.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的悲劇為何一再上演？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:24.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是卡嘉莉正在哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她討厭事情演變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:28.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正在哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:32.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過為一切劃上句號的時候終於來臨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:36.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會把你擊落！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:38.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就在今天  就在這裏！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:41.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以結束一切的時刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:42.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米婭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:46.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你不好  都是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因為你背叛了我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:54.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的答案都已在你們心中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:05.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我宣佈 關乎人類存亡的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:09.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最後防衛策略 Destiny Plan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:11.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在全面啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:17.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉·大和  Freedom 出動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:22.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯拉·薩拉  Justice  出動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:27.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷·紮·巴雷爾  Legend 出動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真·飛鳥  Destiny  出動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:39.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉·大和  只有你的存在…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:41.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不可原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:39.16,Title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}最後之力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:02.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:13.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,集中攻擊永恆號  那是對方的旗艦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:15.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的容後再解決
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:16.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:19.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傳令下去  別讓奧布的餘黨逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.75,0:04:20.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:25.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT的Mobile Suit接近  共20台
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:27.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,G18  Bravo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:29.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵十度  上舵五度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準主炮  別被鎖定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:37.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,掩護永恆號
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:38.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:39.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對空導彈  發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.49,0:04:54.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 這可不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:07.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布艦隊怎麼了？鎮魂曲呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:09.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬恩菲特艦被擊沉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,將從美特蘭戰線撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認須佐之男 草雉和月詠的訊號
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:16.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其他無法確定  外面一片混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:21.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡威恩小隊 路線清空  可以起飛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:25.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 吉倫特小隊 雷文斯沃思小隊 可以起飛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:34.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,岡瓦納級航空母艦在紅區18A
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.95,0:05:37.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit正朝奧布的主艦隊進發
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:39.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:44.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.98,0:05:46.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎能讓你們繼續胡來？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:51.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,朝奧布艦隊進發？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:56.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們中計了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 基拉  這樣下去鎮魂曲會…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:12.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:13.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不攻擊的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們會修復第一個中繼點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.97,0:06:25.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,中繼站二號
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:27.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,離預定位置還有一百六十
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:29.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新創世能量填充達百分之四十
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:31.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布會被擊中！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:44.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse接近！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:46.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:49.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦號從後方迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,蘭多哈特  攻擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.13,0:06:56.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回避  反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:12.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們還真是命硬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:13.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:14.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:19.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這算是什麼？每次都是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:23.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話  我們也無法行動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:36.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭先走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:38.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大天使號也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:40.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.53,0:07:42.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:44.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏由我和永恆號應付
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人全部去鎮魂曲那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.57,0:07:58.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…這是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:04.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這樣  永恆號就會…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:07.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這艘艦  奧布更加重要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:09.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦？伊紮克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:12.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立即去掩護永恆號
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:15.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是紮夫特軍艦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:16.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:21.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布是對抗這個計畫的最後籌碼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:24.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果奧布失守  世界將被吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:27.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以必須保護到底
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們正是為此而來這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:36.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以請你們去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:38.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭  拉米亞斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:40.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:42.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:45.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,稍後一定要再見
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  一定會
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:53.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:54.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會讓你們過去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.55,0:08:57.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦號到底在幹什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:04.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.39,0:09:06.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:07.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:19.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉·大和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷  你也明白的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再等一會就可以了  死守鎮魂曲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:27.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真！你要和密涅瓦號一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:36.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,追擊大天使號
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.53,0:09:41.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom  由我來對付
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:43.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:45.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你去對付Justice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:48.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要幹掉那個叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:57.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是你的工作  給過去來個了斷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:02.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:22.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…  怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:24.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:29.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  要將一切
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要將全部…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:46.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到要塞後方去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:50.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論鐳射炮多強大  打不中就沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:51.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:54.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:09.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 快退下 你這種無名小卒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:12.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  讓人忙不過來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.49,0:11:14.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直沒完沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:16.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要太過分！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom在搞什麼鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.31,0:11:26.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？想求援嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是  笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很驚人的數量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:48.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也只是僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried  發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:54.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉米亞斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:58.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,爭取時間   快點把Requiem…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.73,0:11:59.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在Blue Alpha發現密涅瓦號
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:00.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離十六
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:04.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈接近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:12.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried瞄準  發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Isode  攻擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.13,0:12:26.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Justice？ 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:30.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse？ 露娜瑪麗亞嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:31.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:38.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐  停手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:40.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何你要攻擊我們？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:42.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何你要攻擊我們？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:45.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 為何你要連美玲…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:47.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟然連美玲也…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:51.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！露娜瑪麗亞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:53.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你別逃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.13,0:12:57.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:03.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快退下 我不想向你開火
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:04.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:06.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒時間了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:11.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:13.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:15.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個…叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:18.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.83,0:13:20.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧？露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:22.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:28.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個人！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:46.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然敢… 竟然敢攻擊露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.77,0:13:53.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真！阿斯蘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:56.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,中繼站二號  離預定位置還有一百
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.93,0:13:59.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新創世能量填充達百分之六十
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:03.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永恆號和大天使號還未被擊沉嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:05.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  還未收到擊沉報告
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:08.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Purple1向Green2發出橙色戒備訊號
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Sierra X-Ray November
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:12.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(196,704)}通訊尚未恢復
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:13.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1056,704)}斯特羅夫斯小隊待機中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:27.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  實在很厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:30.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你指什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:39.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:49.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我指戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:51.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:58.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人類真的很喜歡戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:01.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你不喜歡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:04.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不過是想取勝而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:07.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是想戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:21.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過也有勝不過的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:24.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 為什麼會這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:37.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算戰鬥也無法得勝？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:45.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:47.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是誰…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別無選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  人類為何要生存？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何而生？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:15.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我應該說過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.61,0:16:17.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是為了要得知其中原因
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.41,0:16:26.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然你可能不喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的話應該很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:35.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是勞·魯·克魯澤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:43.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我的確不喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不願意那樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:57.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,像你那樣掙扎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:02.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.05,0:17:05.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勞·魯·克魯澤？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:12.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人類的夢想 人類的未來 這個驕人的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:13.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉·大和
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:22.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼這次一定要讓你消失
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和我們一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:35.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:38.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了這重生的新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,呐 勞呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:50.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勞…  已經不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:51.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.85,0:17:57.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 你也是勞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:05.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是你的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:18.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會 你為什麼 你為什麼又…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.67,0:18:22.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法回避的 那就是自己
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:29.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及無法挽回的 那就是過去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:32.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要將一切結束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:35.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這之前所有的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:40.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後回到原本應有的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:44.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人類  世界…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:49.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希爾達！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:52.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:18:59.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:07.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論什麼生命 都是唯一的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:11.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以這生命是你 不是他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Lohengrin  發射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:44.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭君呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:47.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  位置無法確定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:50.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法突破防護層的話 奧布會…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:51.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:53.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:55.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Murasame第一小隊 跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:01.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真  你也該住手了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.33,0:20:04.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  為什麼會被你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:06.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會被你這種人…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:12.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別在過去的糾纏下戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:17.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使那樣 也無法挽回任何東西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:21.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說…說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:24.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你連未來也要扼殺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:38.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以世界才必須被改變
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:45.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才必須攻擊奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:50.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:51.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:55.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,毀滅一切  扼殺未來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:20:59.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要的 真的是那種世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:01.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與力量嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:05.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我是瑪尤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:09.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 瑪尤現在不能接電話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:12.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…喜歡…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:18.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是軟弱 那樣什麼都保護不了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:23.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:26.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.79,0:21:33.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 夠了住手吧  阿斯蘭也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.66,0:21:37.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉  瑪尤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:41.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:49.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.37,0:22:04.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.47,0:23:25.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有這個方法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:27.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若要實現願望的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.67,0:23:31.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從擁有這個信念開始一直行走的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.13,0:23:35.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,懷著不同的思念 如今兵戎相見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.51,0:23:39.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,動手攻擊者 以及 遭到攻擊的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士高達SEED Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.47,0:23:45.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被選擇的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.24,0:23:48.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,朝向全新的時代翱翔吧 Gundam
